  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Given below are two statements:</p><p>Statement I : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> can act as both oxidising and reducing agent in basic medium.</p><p>Statement II : In the hydrogen economy, the energy is transmitted in the form of dihydrogen. In the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
    "image": null
  },
